        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer starring a slice of toast who covers himself in sweet spreads to get fun abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.poster.avif?t=1778855236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.webm?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.mp4?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a dozen abilities, each more amazing than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STICKY HONEY</strong> - Spread honey on your face to stick to objects and climb walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWERFUL CHOCOLATE</strong> - Use hardened chocolate to break obstacles</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And much more after this gif!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.poster.avif?t=1778855236\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.webm?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.mp4?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VACATIONS GONE WRONG</strong> - Welcome to the Jam Session Cruise! Lucky you, you just happened to stumble across a ticket for a lovely vacation at sea! At least, until you discover that this boat can barely float!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DELICIOUSLY SWEET LEVELS</strong> - Explore dozens of levels and find huge candies to fuel the boat. From fruity cakes to tropical jungles to haunted floating islands (and more!), get bready for some tasty sights!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FRIENDLY TOASTS EVERYWHERE</strong> - You're not alone on this cruise; lots of other toasts are along for the ride! Get to know them: they’ve all got a good reason for being there. Maybe you can help them?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>NEO-RETRO GAMEPLAY</strong> - Got a taste for platformers? Discover this toast's original moveset: slap, aerial dash, French toast (absorb and spit out liquid!!)... No spoilers, we'll stop the list here...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>TONS OF COLLECTIBLES</strong> - Like collecting lots of shiny little things? You’re going to loaf it! Reach for the stars with 100% completion!!!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>CHALLENGES FOR THE BRAVE</strong> - Want to give yourself a slice of hard mode? This cruise has some nice surprises in store! But don't panic, all these challenges are optional.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Now there's just one thing left to do...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/fcb75108a8d6e8a3e2c2d51cd70d987f.poster.avif?t=1778855236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/fcb75108a8d6e8a3e2c2d51cd70d987f.webm?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/fcb75108a8d6e8a3e2c2d51cd70d987f.mp4?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pardon My French Toast is a 3D platformer starring a slice of toast who covers himself in sweet spreads to get fun abilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.poster.avif?t=1778855236\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.webm?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/71dd10752c2550954d0478ea93f38abd.mp4?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Learn a dozen abilities, each more amazing than the last!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>STICKY HONEY</strong> - Spread honey on your face to stick to objects and climb walls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>POWERFUL CHOCOLATE</strong> - Use hardened chocolate to break obstacles</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>And much more after this gif!</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.poster.avif?t=1778855236\" width=800 height=288 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.webm?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3407360/extras/3bcf684bdaf5eab5fab51d175c72bb58.mp4?t=1778855236\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A piece of cake?!</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>VACATIONS GONE 